    "description": "This lot includes seven raw tourmaline mineral specimens ranging from 10mm to 23mm in size. The collection features primarily pink rough crystals, including translucent pink tourmaline with natural striations, black schorl tourmaline, and one piece with greenish tones. The total weight is 10.7 grams as measured on an AWS-600 scale. All specimens are unpolished and in natural condition, suitable for display, lapidary work, or collection purposes.\nGrab Bag/ Assortment Policy:\n\n*Some items may show more wear than others. Issues can include, but not limited to: Scuffs, chips, cracks, bends, kinks, missing components or needing repairs.\n\n*There is no guarantee on rarity or completeness of any sets that may be included in a grab bag / assortment.\n\n*Grab bags /Assortments come as is with no refunds or returns.\n\n*We are unable to answer questions about specific items within a grab bag/ assortment. Please view the provided photographs to determine general contents.\n\n*Due to the nature of donations used items may have unforeseen damage not noted in the description.",
